<title>LUXEMBOURG: DuPont invests 585 mln luf in Mylar R&amp;D.</title>
<headline>DuPont invests 585 mln luf in Mylar R&amp;D.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. chemicals group E.I. DuPont de Nemours is investing 585 million Luxembourg francs in research and development for its new Mylar production line in Contern, Luxembourg, the Luxembourg Economics Ministry said.</p>
<p>The R&amp;D project has the backing of the Luxembourg government.</p>
<p>The 2.5 billion franc production line of Mylar polyester films, which is to come on stream in 1998, will supply value-added markets such as condensers, reprographic and specialist packaging films.</p>
<p>DuPont is one of the 10 largest employers in Luxembourg.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
